        "problem": "Given that $y\\ge 0,$ which of the following is equivalent to $\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\sqrt{y}?$",
        "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061(\\sqrt{y})=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}}).\n$$",
